WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:11,890
This damn weather

2
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:13,550
It’s not easy to do it yourself

3
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,230
Don't worry, I'll go down and help you

4
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,430
I don't know this person since I don't know him

5
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:18,950
Then he can only come here for the fish.

6
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:21,550
Anyone who can be a fishmonger is a human being. Deal with them.

7
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:22,950
You must keep your spirits high

8
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:25,350
Brother, throw the rope down and I'll fix it for you.

9
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,300
Don't be angry, slap me

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,920
Brother, your batch of black carvings are of good quality. What price do you want to sell them for?

11
00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,360
Are you a fisherman or a buyer?

12
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:00,440
What buyer?

13
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,640
Just a second-rate dealer making a living

14
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,560
That's my shop

15
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:06,280
I have been receiving goods at this terminal for a long time

16
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,680
Everyone who comes here knows me

17
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:08,880
But you, brother

18
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,200
I got a bit of a look

19
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:11,360
This guy has fair skin

20
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:13,440
He doesn't look like the kind of person who goes to sea for a long time.

21
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,800
Don’t understand all kinds of doubts about prices

22
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:15,840
The most doubtful

23
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,640
Are you treating me like a raw melon?
